# ShuttleNet environment variables.
#
# Copy to `.env` and fill in real values:
#
#     cp .env.example .env
#
# `.env` is git-ignored. Never commit real credentials.

# --- Required -------------------------------------------------------------
#
# The public Supabase connection. These are safe to expose to the browser: the
# publishable (anon) key is protected by Row Level Security, not by secrecy.
#
# The app reads the VITE_ pair in the browser bundle and the plain pair during
# server-side rendering, so both forms are needed. They hold the same values.
#
# A build fails if either pair is missing. See src/integrations/supabase/client.ts.

SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# --- Optional: server-side and operator scripts ---------------------------
#
# Server-side only. NOT read by the frontend, and MUST NEVER be given a VITE_
# prefix - any variable with that prefix is compiled into the client bundle and
# would leak full database access to every visitor.
#
# Used by src/integrations/supabase/client.server.ts and by the operator scripts
# in scripts/ that reset or seed tournament data. Not needed for development or
# for the test suites.

# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# --- Optional: script authentication --------------------------------------
#
# Alternatives to the service-role key for scripts/reset-tournament-data.mjs and
# scripts/fake-day-one-results.mjs.

# SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN=
# SUPABASE_DESK_EMAIL=
# SUPABASE_DESK_PASSWORD=

# --- Optional: test harness ----------------------------------------------
#
# Credentials for scripts/record-staff-session.mjs, which records a real staff
# session into e2e/.auth/staff.json for manual checks against a live backend.
#
# This is NOT required for `npm run test:e2e`: the Playwright suite is hermetic
# and supplies a synthetic session, so it needs no credentials at all.

# E2E_STAFF_EMAIL=
# E2E_STAFF_PASSWORD=

# Port and base URL for the Playwright web server. Defaults to 8080.
# PLAYWRIGHT_PORT=
# PLAYWRIGHT_BASE_URL=
